#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The KPD is dominatated by Marxist Leninist, considered the "center" of the party, but this can change. Will new problems require us to change tactics?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @left_opposition: A focus on immediate revolution and distancing ourselves from Stalin is the best path.
- @marxist_leninist: The Marxism-Leninism of espoused by our current leadership and the Comintern will remain.
- @right_opposition: Work councils and a non-authoritarian socialist government will be more effective that our vanguard party.
- @conciliators: It is necessary to work with trade unions and the SPD to stop fascism.
- @easy_discard

@left_opposition
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "left_opposition") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "left_opposition"; left_opposition_strength += 10; communist_coalition -= 1; left_dissent -= 5; spd_relation -= 5; nationalization_support += 1

A more radical path must be taken to spread the revolution not just to Germany, but to the rest of Europe.

@marxist_leninist
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "marxist_leninist") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "marxist_leninist"; marxist_leninist_strength += 10; marxist_leninist -= 10; left_dissent -= 5; reformist_dissent -= 5

The Marxist leninists, represented by Thälmann and current party leadership, strengthening the vanguard party and its connections to the working class.

@right_opposition
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "right_opposition") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "right_opposition"; right_opposition_strength += 10; right_opposition_dissent -= 5; spd_relation += 3

The Right Opposition focuses on increasing our influence on work councils and unions to connect to the working class.

@conciliators
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "conciliator") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "conciliators"; conciliator_strength += 10; democratization += 1; conciliators_dissent -= 5; spd_relation += 8

Fascism is our most immediate threat, working with the SPD and maybe even the bourgeois parties is necessary.

@changed
on-arrival: left_opposition_dissent += 5; marxist_leninist_dissent += 5; right_opposition_dissent += 5; conciliator_dissent += 5

We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
